---
import { Sparkles, ArrowUpRight, Flame, Layers } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-gold font-semibold">
      Colecciones Selectas
    </span>
    <h2 class="font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide mt-2">
      Curaduría Olfativa de Autor
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-3">
      Explora nuestras cuatro líneas principales inspiradas en la opulencia de oriente y la alta costura europea.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Bento Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <!-- Card 1: Perfumes Árabes (Spans 2 columns) -->
    <a
      href="/catalogo?categoria=arabe"
      class="group relative md:col-span-2 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-brand-surface border border-white/10 p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[320px] sm:min-h-[380px] hover:border-brand-gold/40 transition-all duration-300 shadow-luxury"
    >
      <!-- Background Image with Dark Gradient -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594035910387-fea47794261f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
          alt="Perfumería Árabe"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-30 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-dark via-brand-dark/70 to-transparent" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30 backdrop-blur-md">
            <Flame class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            Tendencia Mundial
          </span>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/5 group-hover:bg-brand-gold group-hover:text-brand-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300">
            <ArrowUpRight class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-lg mt-12">
        <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide group-hover:text-brand-gold-light transition-colors">
          Perfumería Árabe de Lujo
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Las creaciones más virales de Dubai y Emiratos: Lattafa, Afnan y Armaf. Estelas arrolladoras, acordes gourmand, canela, dátiles y oud genuino.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold tracking-wider uppercase group-hover:underline">
          Ver fragancias árabes en stock →
        </span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Card 2: El Arte del Decant -->
    <a
      href="/decants"
      class="group relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-brand-surface border border-white/10 p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[320px] sm:min-h-[380px] hover:border-brand-gold/40 transition-all duration-300 shadow-luxury"
    >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547887537-6158d64c35b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
          alt="Decants Le Désir"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-25 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-dark via-brand-dark/70 to-transparent" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 border border-blue-500/30 backdrop-blur-md">
            <Layers class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            5ml & 10ml
          </span>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/5 group-hover:bg-brand-gold group-hover:text-brand-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300">
            <ArrowUpRight class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mt-12">
        <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide group-hover:text-brand-gold-light transition-colors">
          El Arte del Decanting
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Prueba perfumes de nicho y diseñador en tu propia piel durante semanas antes de invertir en la botella completa.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold tracking-wider uppercase group-hover:underline">
          Explorar decants →
        </span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Card 3: Diseñador Internacional (Próximamente / No disponible) -->
    <div
      class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-brand-surface/60 border border-white/10 p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[300px] shadow-luxury opacity-75 cursor-not-allowed select-none"
    >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1615397349754-cfa2066a298e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
          alt="Diseñador"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-15 grayscale"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-dark via-brand-dark/85 to-transparent" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 border border-white/10">
          <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400/60" />
          Próximamente
        </span>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-400 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
          No disponible
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mt-8">
        <h3 class="font-editorial text-xl font-bold text-zinc-300 tracking-wide">
          Diseñador & Nicho
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">
          Próximamente incorporaremos las casas más prestigiosas: Dior, Tom Ford, Creed y Jean Paul Gaultier.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-500 tracking-wider uppercase">
          🔒 Próximamente en stock
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4: Extras & Accesorios (Spans 2 columns) -->
    <a
      href="/catalogo?categoria=extra"
      class="group relative md:col-span-2 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-brand-surface border border-white/10 p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[300px] hover:border-brand-gold/40 transition-all duration-300 shadow-luxury"
    >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522335789203-aabd1fc54bc9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
          alt="Accesorios de Perfumería"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-25 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-dark via-brand-dark/70 to-transparent" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 backdrop-blur-md">
          <Sparkles class="w-3 h-3" />
          Complementos de Lujo
        </span>
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/5 group-hover:bg-brand-gold group-hover:text-brand-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300">
          <ArrowUpRight class="w-4 h-4" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-lg mt-8">
        <h3 class="font-editorial text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide group-hover:text-brand-gold-light transition-colors">
          Atomizadores Recargables & Discovery Boxes
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-300 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">
          Atomizadores portátiles anti-fugas con acabado cuero y cajas de regalo con 5 joyas árabes listas para obsequiar.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>